{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"affirmative action in algorithms affirmative action in algorithms","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md","fileName":"Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Affirmative Action in Algorithms","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Algorithmic Fairness and Justice]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algorithmic Fairness and Justice","Fairness Through Unawareness","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"affirmative action in algorithms affirmative action in algorithms","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md","fileName":"Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Affirmative Action in Algorithms","heading":"Affirmative Action in Algorithms","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Affirmative action in algorithms intentionally considers disadvantage or group membership to counter exclusion and unequal starting conditions. It rejects the idea that identical formal treatment is always fair when the data and institutions were shaped by earlier injustice.\n\nThe approach is ethically contested because it distributes opportunities differently in order to pursue a more equitable result. Its use requires a stated theory of justice, clear scope, and evaluation of effects. Unlike [[Fairness Through Unawareness]], it makes the corrective value choice visible rather than hiding it behind a claim of neutrality.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algorithmic Fairness and Justice","Fairness Through Unawareness","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"affirmative action in algorithms affirmative action in algorithms","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md","fileName":"Affirmative Action in Algorithms.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Affirmative Action in Algorithms","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[aiethics.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Algorithmic Fairness and Justice","Fairness Through Unawareness","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}